        "type": "actions",
        "text": "The PM will check the updated project requirements (teletext removal, remote usage scope for television, corporate image) and update at the next meeting."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011b#1",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "The hold-one-to-power idea would be hard to implement."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "ES2011b#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Users may be confused about powering the device if there is no separate power button."
